%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:75 (writeCsv-quoteValues-test)
testing: quoteValues escapes quotes in values
元の形: io/writeCsv の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write([{"name": "Alice \"A\""}], "application/csv", {"quoteValues": true})
%%% output application/json
"name\n\"Alice \\\"A\\\"\"\n"
